<view class="page">
  <view class="topbar">
    <view>
      <view class="title">点菜记录</view>
      <view class="subtitle">以后不知道吃什么，就翻这里</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id">
    <view class="row">
      <view>
        <view class="name">{{item.createdAt}}</view>
        <view class="meta">{{item.items.length}} 道菜，共 {{item.totalQty}} 份</view>
      </view>
      <button class="danger-btn" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="confirmRemove">删除</button>
    </view>

    <view class="dish-line" wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:for-item="dish" wx:key="id">
      <text>{{dish.name}}</text>
      <text>x {{dish.qty}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="note" wx:if="{{item.note}}">{{item.note}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!orders.length}}">
    暂时没有记录。去“今日点菜”保存一顿饭吧。
  </view>
</view>
